  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v100-p2-u1-v1",
      "text": "天福十二年夏五月乙酉初一，契丹任命的大丞相、政事令、东京留守、燕王赵延寿，被永康王乌裕拘禁。不久，乌裕在镇州官署召集蕃汉臣僚，假传契丹主临终诏命，命自己继位，于是发丧，按礼服丧。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "89a8f65d21544036848359e9e235ceb76dc44e023f2c05e09e8ebb2e62370a61",
      "originalEnd": 76,
      "paragraphId": "old-v100-p2",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 0,
      "originalSha256": "de33d7bc3c930184c2a1c9c705442837588419b6606161a7cc1f216e8bdbe995",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1273",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "ff9cca8d7560c30dc61183a3a22b37fef17e6b43d482b20a99043deb6560f241",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v100-p2-u2-v1",
      "text": "辛卯，下诏定五月十二日皇帝南行。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "077984e2dde9eafd8c76c8dfb45bfd752d3b17ea97a55cfa30c696c235c26131",
      "originalEnd": 91,
      "paragraphId": "old-v100-p2",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 76,
      "originalSha256": "de33d7bc3c930184c2a1c9c705442837588419b6606161a7cc1f216e8bdbe995",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1273",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "ff9cca8d7560c30dc61183a3a22b37fef17e6b43d482b20a99043deb6560f241",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v100-p2-u3-v1",
      "text": "甲午，任主管太原府事务的刘崇为北京留守，并命皇子刘承训负责宫禁巡检。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "a90d53d3bd89284c37384ffe7888d4a5487d9916ccca1f6a0b3f0c64b5e79c07",
      "originalEnd": 114,
      "paragraphId": "old-v100-p2",
      "reviewNotes": [
        "底本在“命皇子承训”后以句号断开任命语句；“宫禁巡检”的职事依据紧接的下一原句补明，原句范围保留。"
      ],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 91,
      "originalSha256": "de33d7bc3c930184c2a1c9c705442837588419b6606161a7cc1f216e8bdbe995",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1273",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "ff9cca8d7560c30dc61183a3a22b37fef17e6b43d482b20a99043deb6560f241",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v100-p2-u4-v1",
      "text": "（接前句）又命武德使李晖负责宫禁巡检。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "8287ef90044f4f3dfaefe8e3eadc05e41d74c0b57c47e2f30e698ba74ed5bd85",
      "originalEnd": 124,
      "paragraphId": "old-v100-p2",
      "reviewNotes": [
        "接续前句的任命语句，刘承训、李晖共同负责大内巡检；此译补明省略的任命动作，底本断句和原句范围不变。"
      ],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 114,
      "originalSha256": "de33d7bc3c930184c2a1c9c705442837588419b6606161a7cc1f216e8bdbe995",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1273",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "ff9cca8d7560c30dc61183a3a22b37fef17e6b43d482b20a99043deb6560f241",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v100-p2-u5-v1",
      "text": "丙申，皇帝离开河东，经阴地关前往东京。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "3506a523ab1cb9174894365620530dd11587556998b52a670ff12b899c153a69",
      "originalEnd": 141,
      "paragraphId": "old-v100-p2",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 124,
      "originalSha256": "de33d7bc3c930184c2a1c9c705442837588419b6606161a7cc1f216e8bdbe995",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1273",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "ff9cca8d7560c30dc61183a3a22b37fef17e6b43d482b20a99043deb6560f241",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v100-p2-u6-v1",
      "text": "当时星官说太岁在午，南巡不利，所以改走阴地关。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "1d1206d855f4c3b59eab5b68e9b9248f3b7b1ad641816a6b8f0623dc350b1726",
      "originalEnd": 162,
      "paragraphId": "old-v100-p2",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 141,
      "originalSha256": "de33d7bc3c930184c2a1c9c705442837588419b6606161a7cc1f216e8bdbe995",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1273",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "ff9cca8d7560c30dc61183a3a22b37fef17e6b43d482b20a99043deb6560f241",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v100-p2-u7-v1",
      "text": "丁酉，史宏肇奏报，泽州刺史翟令奇献州投降。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "2a8589b5f29fb53ffbf8892e7c93c9c748f68c665207ddb2018a66f46d9d0c29",
      "originalEnd": 182,
      "paragraphId": "old-v100-p2",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 162,
      "originalSha256": "de33d7bc3c930184c2a1c9c705442837588419b6606161a7cc1f216e8bdbe995",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1273",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "ff9cca8d7560c30dc61183a3a22b37fef17e6b43d482b20a99043deb6560f241",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v100-p2-u8-v1",
      "text": "〈（《宋史·李万超传》记载：史宏肇经过泽州，刺史翟令奇固守拒命。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "6c4718529f64c4881ed56aa1b61c096ad8cc863c93f5b8268dd6810bb131f9b0",
      "originalEnd": 212,
      "paragraphId": "old-v100-p2",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 182,
      "originalSha256": "de33d7bc3c930184c2a1c9c705442837588419b6606161a7cc1f216e8bdbe995",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1273",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "ff9cca8d7560c30dc61183a3a22b37fef17e6b43d482b20a99043deb6560f241",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v100-p2-u9-v1",
      "text": "李万超驰至城下，劝谕说：“如今契丹北逃，天下无主，并州刘公秉持大义，安定中原，所到之处望风归附，晚归顺的人要被灭族，何不早作打算？”",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "6f672e8c942d096b95e6433f1345609b83233cd45443112b18cf2e1fe636d47c",
      "originalEnd": 264,
      "paragraphId": "old-v100-p2",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 212,
      "originalSha256": "de33d7bc3c930184c2a1c9c705442837588419b6606161a7cc1f216e8bdbe995",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1273",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "ff9cca8d7560c30dc61183a3a22b37fef17e6b43d482b20a99043deb6560f241",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v100-p2-u10-v1",
      "text": "翟令奇于是开门迎接，史宏肇便留下李万超暂管州事。）〉",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "7e55763143d07a9614d283f4b5d4a2770b03d0acbf3f98cc0ab02b9e337f09f5",
      "originalEnd": 284,
      "paragraphId": "old-v100-p2",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 264,
      "originalSha256": "de33d7bc3c930184c2a1c9c705442837588419b6606161a7cc1f216e8bdbe995",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1273",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "ff9cca8d7560c30dc61183a3a22b37fef17e6b43d482b20a99043deb6560f241",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v100-p2-u11-v1",
      "text": "同日，契丹任命的汴州节度使萧翰迎接郇国公李从益到东京，请他主管南朝军国事务。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "fda255c521079487f1a1ca09888e12fe87d7f77b173ad5c5258efcb4db109f58",
      "originalEnd": 319,
      "paragraphId": "old-v100-p2",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 284,
      "originalSha256": "de33d7bc3c930184c2a1c9c705442837588419b6606161a7cc1f216e8bdbe995",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1273",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "ff9cca8d7560c30dc61183a3a22b37fef17e6b43d482b20a99043deb6560f241",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v100-p2-u12-v1",
      "text": "己亥，萧翰离开东京北去。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "9f7a21e561d46d01937a6be48950347b5f72e6302b06ba7d548e0530d03f885b",
      "originalEnd": 331,
      "paragraphId": "old-v100-p2",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 319,
      "originalSha256": "de33d7bc3c930184c2a1c9c705442837588419b6606161a7cc1f216e8bdbe995",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1273",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "ff9cca8d7560c30dc61183a3a22b37fef17e6b43d482b20a99043deb6560f241",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v100-p2-u13-v1",
      "text": "乙巳，契丹永康王乌裕从镇州回北方，行至定州，任定州节度副使耶律忠为定州节度使，孙方简为云州节度使。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "36ab0eac205aa64fecffc709487067507b3fe9a15790f14cd8e42fb5bd743f75",
      "originalEnd": 379,
      "paragraphId": "old-v100-p2",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 331,
      "originalSha256": "de33d7bc3c930184c2a1c9c705442837588419b6606161a7cc1f216e8bdbe995",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1273",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "ff9cca8d7560c30dc61183a3a22b37fef17e6b43d482b20a99043deb6560f241",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v100-p2-u14-v1",
      "text": "孙方简不受命，回到狼山。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "7edb50824765a2c39e2038bc71d7c037f0aad9353943a5c04d4a560677ddd911",
      "originalEnd": 390,
      "paragraphId": "old-v100-p2",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 379,
      "originalSha256": "de33d7bc3c930184c2a1c9c705442837588419b6606161a7cc1f216e8bdbe995",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1273",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "ff9cca8d7560c30dc61183a3a22b37fef17e6b43d482b20a99043deb6560f241",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v100-p2-u15-v1",
      "text": "戊申，皇帝到绛州，本州刺史李从朗献州投降。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "e4fbe696bf484a2323252075c52ccfeebe8a782ede4c64521585102914a7bfe9",
      "originalEnd": 410,
      "paragraphId": "old-v100-p2",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 390,
      "originalSha256": "de33d7bc3c930184c2a1c9c705442837588419b6606161a7cc1f216e8bdbe995",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1273",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "ff9cca8d7560c30dc61183a3a22b37fef17e6b43d482b20a99043deb6560f241",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-old-v100-p2-u16-v1",
      "text": "此前，契丹派偏将成霸卿、曹可璠等守州。皇帝起兵之初，他们没有及时归顺；等皇帝来到，在城下展示兵威，却不让进攻，李从朗等于是投降。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "3252c87ea3cd4b1b6e1661d852eb53abcceb5080b7348c6c06c1efd406db0179",
      "originalEnd": 463,
      "paragraphId": "old-v100-p2",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 410,
